      "updated_at": "2026-02-03T07:41:59Z",
      "body": "The issue is that INSERT OR REPLACE silently failed on an existing database but worked on fresh databases (as you might have noticed).\nBy the time I switched to ON CONFLICT DO UPDATE SET I got this fixed it for that specific iteration. \n\nBut then I dropped the table several times, and now attempting again to re-run a conflicting situation yield only good results. So long story short I cannot reproduce anymore and I don't have anymore the original db where I recorded the bug. \n\nFeel free to close if no longer requiring attention.",
